---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<BaseLayout home>
  <div class="shell page">
    <h1>Ryan Michaels</h1>

    <p>
      I'm a builder of GTM systems. I generate pipeline for Pave.
    </p>

    <p>I write about what I've <a href="/writing">built</a>.</p>

    <p>
      The other two things I spend time on are sabermetrics and synthesizers. Both are
      taking the back off to see the parts, which is the only way I've ever learned
      anything I kept.
    </p>

    <p>
      My code is on <a href={site.github}>GitHub</a>, the rest of me is on{' '}
      <a href={site.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>, and the best way to reach me is{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>email</a>. I read everything and answer most
      things.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page { padding-top: 4.5rem; }

  h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.014em;
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
  }

  p { margin: 0 0 1.15rem; }
  .page > p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
</style>
